<h3 class="bold" id="breakpoint-order"><a class="underline reset-text-decoration" href="image#breakpoint-order">Breakpoint order</a></h3>
<p>While ODS uses mobile first breakpoints, they <strong>MUST</strong> be ordered <strong>from
largest to smallest</strong> in this scenario as they are used to render <span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token code-tag punctuation" style="color:hsl(119, 34%, 47%)">&lt;</span><span class="token code-tag" style="color:hsl(5, 74%, 59%)">source</span><span class="token code-tag" style="color:hsl(5, 74%, 59%)"> </span><span class="token code-tag punctuation" style="color:hsl(119, 34%, 47%)">/&gt;</span></span></code></span> elements.</p>
<p><span class="code-wrapper code-container inline" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><code class="code code--inline prism-code language-markup code-inline"><span class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token code-tag punctuation" style="color:hsl(119, 34%, 47%)">&lt;</span><span class="token code-tag" style="color:hsl(5, 74%, 59%)">source</span><span class="token code-tag" style="color:hsl(5, 74%, 59%)"> </span><span class="token code-tag punctuation" style="color:hsl(119, 34%, 47%)">/&gt;</span></span></code></span> elements are evaluated first to last, which means larger rules need to be specified first.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>If the source&#x27;s media condition evaluates to false, the browser skips it and evaluates the next element inside picture</p>
<p><a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Element/picture#The_media_attribute" class="underline">The Picture element</a> on MDN</p>
</blockquote>
<pre><div class="code-wrapper code-container block" style="background-color:hsl(230, 1%, 98%);color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><pre class="language-markup pre-block"><code class="code prism-code language-markup code-block"><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">default: &#x27;/path/to/default/image&#x27;, // default image to load (fallback)</span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">  // order from largest to smallest</span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">  xxxl: &#x27;/path/to/xxxl/image&#x27;,</span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">  xxl: &#x27;/path/to/xxl/image&#x27;,</span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">  xl: &#x27;/path/to/xl/image&#x27;,</span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">  lg: &#x27;/path/to/lg/image&#x27;,</span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">  md: &#x27;/path/to/md/image&#x27;,</span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">  sm: &#x27;/path/to/sm/image&#x27;,</span></div><div class="token-line" style="color:hsl(230, 8%, 24%)"><span class="token plain">  xs: &#x27;/path/to/xs/image&#x27;,</span></div></code></pre></div></pre>
